          "id": "g1wdmkfpm2r9",
          "status": "monitoring",
          "body": "We continue to monitor this issue with several ISPs showing resolution. \n\nIf you are encountering this issue, we would appreciate knowing what ISP (Internet Service Provider) you are on when you report the issue.\n\nWe are working with affected ISPs to get the erroneous DNS entries cleared from their residual cache layers.",
